#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:-1
msgid "Kdenlive Documentation - Library"
msgstr "Dokumentácia Kdenlive – Library"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:-1
msgid ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, library, copy paste between projects, editing, documentation, "
"user manual, add clips, project bin, asset, management, video editor, open "
"source, free, learn, easy"
msgstr ""
"KDE, Kdenlive, library, copy paste between projects, editing,documentation,  "
"user manual, add clips, project bin, asset,management, video editor, open  "
"source, free, learn, easy"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:15
msgid "Library"
msgstr "Knižnica"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:19
msgid ""
"The **Library** is Kdenlive's way to copy and paste sets of clips and "
"transitions between different projects. It is not just a clipboard, but "
"instead it is a library for all the things you use in more than one project."
msgstr ""
"**Knižnica** je spôsob, akým Kdenlive umožňuje kopírovanie a vkladanie sád "
"klipov a prechodov medzi rôznymi projektmi. Nie je to len schránka, ale "
"knižnica pre všetky veci, ktoré používate vo viac ako jednom projekte."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:21
msgid ""
"You enable the library through the menu item :doc:`View </user_interface/"
"menu/view_menu>`."
msgstr ""
"Knižnicu povolíte prostredníctvom položky ponuky :doc:`Zobraziť</"
"user_interface/menu/view_menu>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:26
msgid "Add Clips to the Library"
msgstr "Pridanie klipov do knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:32
msgid "Library with example folders"
msgstr "Knižnica s príkladovými priečinkami"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:34
msgid ""
"The **Library** is Kdenlive's central place **for copying and pasting "
"between projects**."
msgstr ""
"**Knižnica** je centrálne miesto Kdenlive **na kopírovanie a vkladanie medzi "
"projektmi**."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:36
msgid ""
"By default, the library is empty. For illustration purposes folders for "
"**Audio**, **Video** and **Stock** footage have been created."
msgstr ""
"Predvolene je knižnica prázdna. Na ilustráciu boli vytvorené priečinky pre "
"**Audio**, **Video** a **Stock** záznamy."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:39
msgid ""
"The library should look slightly familiar, as it works and behaves similar "
"to the :doc:`project bin </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`. "
"However, while the project bin changes with each project, the library is "
"independent of your projects. It is always the same library, there is only "
"one of it."
msgstr ""
"Knižnica by mala vyzerať trochu povedome, pretože funguje a správa sa "
"podobne ako :doc:`kôš projektu</project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`. "
"Na rozdiel od koša projektu, ktorý sa mení pri každom projekte, je knižnica "
"nezávislá od vašich projektov. Je to vždy rovnaká knižnica, existuje len "
"jedna."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:42
msgid ""
"A quite useful :doc:`workspace layout </user_interface/workspace_layouts>` "
"is to group the library together with the project bin, and optionally the "
"project notes. This way, you do not need extra screen space for the library, "
"yet it is no further away than just a single click."
msgstr ""
"Celkom užitočné :doc:`rozloženie pracovného priestoru </user_interface/"
"workspace_layouts>` je zoskupiť knižnicu spolu s košom projektu, prípadne aj "
"poznámkami projektu. Takto nepotrebujete pre knižnicu ďalší priestor na "
"obrazovke, no stále je dostupná na jediný klik."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:50
msgid "Timeline with clips selected for the library"
msgstr "Časová os s klipmi vybranými pre knižnicu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:52
msgid ""
"Next, select some clips, as well as transitions/compositions, in the "
"timeline. You can load an existing project and select some timeline clips "
"and transitions at any time in order to copy it into your library. There is "
"no separate import. Simply load a project or create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Ďalej vyberte niektoré klipy, ako aj prechody/kompozície na časovej osi. "
"Môžete kedykoľvek načítať existujúci projekt a vybrať niektoré klipy a "
"prechody na časovej osi, aby ste ich mohli skopírovať do knižnice. "
"Neexistuje žiadny samostatný import. Jednoducho načítajte projekt alebo "
"vytvorte nový."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:60
msgid "Library widget"
msgstr "Widget knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:62
msgid ""
"Switch to the library :term:`widget`, if you have not yet done so. Then "
"press the |bookmark|\\ :guilabel:`Add Timeline Selection to Library` button."
msgstr ""
"Prepnite na :term:`widget` knižnice, ak ste tak ešte neurobili. Potom "
"stlačte tlačidlo |bookmark|\\ :guilabel:`Add Timeline Selection to Library`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:70
msgid "Enter name for new library item"
msgstr "Zadajte názov pre novú položku knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:72
msgid ""
"Kdenlive now asks you to **name your new library item**. Give it some name, "
"and click :guilabel:`OK` to copy the selected timeline clips (with effects) "
"and transitions into your library."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive vás teraz vyzve, aby ste **pomenovali novú položku knižnice**. "
"Zadajte nejaký názov a kliknite na :guilabel:`OK`, čím skopírujete vybrané "
"klipy na časovej osi (s efektmi) a prechody do knižnice."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:80
msgid "Library with the newly created item"
msgstr "Knižnica s novo vytvorenou položkou"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:82
msgid ""
"You can even **neatly organize** your library items **into folders** and sub-"
"folders. This is similar to what you know from Kdenlive's :doc:`(project) "
"bin </project_and_asset_management/project_bin>`, where you also can use :"
"doc:`folders </project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"project_bin_use_folders>` to organize your project (source) clips."
msgstr ""
"Môžete dokonca **prehľadne usporiadať** položky knižnice **do priečinkov** a "
"podpriečinkov. Je to podobné tomu, čo poznáte z :doc:`koša (projektu)</"
"project_and_asset_management/project_bin>` v Kdenlive, kde môžete tiež "
"používať :doc:`priečinky</project_and_asset_management/project_bin/"
"project_bin_use_folders>` na organizovanie klipov projektu (zdrojových)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:84
msgid ""
"Use the |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Add Folder` button at the bottom of the "
"library to create a new folder. You can rearrange library items and folders "
"at any time by simple dragging them into their new place.\\ [1]_"
msgstr ""
"Použite tlačidlo |folder-new|\\ :guilabel:`Add Folder` v dolnej časti "
"knižnice na vytvorenie nového priečinka. Položky knižnice a priečinky môžete "
"kedykoľvek presúvať jednoduchým potiahnutím na nové miesto.\\ [1]_"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:92
msgid "Copy Library Item into (New) Project"
msgstr "Kopírovanie položky knižnice do (nového) projektu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:100
msgid "Library with new item to be copied to project bin"
msgstr "Knižnica s novou položkou, ktorá sa má skopírovať do koša projektu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:102
msgid ""
"Open the library pane and **select the library item** you want to copy into "
"your project, and press the |kdenlive-add-clip|\\ :guilabel:`Add Clip to "
"Project` button (up to Kdenlive 16.08.1 this is instead the :guilabel:`+` "
"button, located in the same place)."
msgstr ""
"Otvorte panel knižnice a **vyberte položku knižnice**, ktorú chcete "
"skopírovať do projektu, a stlačte tlačidlo |kdenlive-add-clip|\\ :guilabel:"
"`Add Clip to Project` (do verzie Kdenlive 16.08.1 je namiesto neho tlačidlo :"
"guilabel:`+`, umiestnené na rovnakom mieste)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:112
msgid "Project bin with the new library item as a separate clip"
msgstr "Kôš projektu s novou položkou knižnice ako samostatným klipom"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:114
msgid "Your project bin now contains the new library item you have just added."
msgstr ""
"Váš kôš projektu teraz obsahuje novú položku knižnice, ktorú ste práve "
"pridali."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:116
msgid ""
"You can rename library items at any time: |input-mouse-click-right|, then :"
"guilabel:`Rename Library Clip`.\\ [2]_"
msgstr ""
"Položky knižnice môžete kedykoľvek premenovať: |input-mouse-click-right|, "
"potom :guilabel:`Rename Library Clip`.\\ [2]_"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:124
msgid "Drag Library Item into Timeline"
msgstr "Presunutie položky knižnice na časovú os"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:130
msgid "Timeline with the library clip as a single clip"
msgstr "Časová os s klipom knižnice ako samostatným klipom"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:132
msgid ""
"A library item behaves like any other clip. You can drag it into the "
"timeline, wherever you want."
msgstr ""
"Položka knižnice sa správa ako každý iný klip. Môžete ju pretiahnuť na "
"časovú os kdekoľvek chcete."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:135
msgid ""
"You cannot directly drag a library item from the library into your timeline. "
"You always need to add it to your project bin first."
msgstr ""
"Položku knižnice nemôžete priamo presunúť z knižnice na časovú os. Vždy ju "
"musíte najprv pridať do koša projektu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:143
msgid "Expand Library Clip"
msgstr "Rozbalenie klipu knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:151
msgid ":menuselection:`Menu --> Sequence`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Menu --> Sequence`"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:153
msgid ""
"Often, you want to edit the contents of a library clip right after after you "
"have placed it on the timeline. **Expanding** means that you want to break "
"up a library clip into its contents for further editing. So, simply select "
"the library clip in the timeline. Then choose :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"Sequence --> Current Clip --> Expand Clip`. Alternatively, you can :doc:"
"`create a keyboard shortcut </user_interface/menu/settings_menu/"
"configure_shortcuts>` for that."
msgstr ""
"Často budete chcieť upraviť obsah klipu knižnice hneď po jeho umiestnení na "
"časovú os. **Rozbalenie** znamená, že chcete rozdeliť klip knižnice na jeho "
"obsah pre ďalšie úpravy. Jednoducho vyberte klip knižnice na časovej osi. "
"Potom zvoľte :menuselection:`Menu --> Sequence --> Current Clip --> Expand "
"Clip`. Alternatívne môžete pre túto funkciu :doc:`vytvoriť klávesovú "
"skratku</user_interface/menu/settings_menu/configure_shortcuts>`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:161
msgid "Timeline with the expanded library clip"
msgstr "Časová os s rozbaleným klipom z knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:163
msgid ""
"You can now edit the expanded contents as you would edit any other timeline "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Teraz môžete upravovať rozbalený obsah rovnako, ako by ste upravovali "
"akýkoľvek iný obsah časovej osi."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:172
msgid "Project bin with expanded library Clip"
msgstr "Kôš projektu s rozbaleným klipom z knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:174
msgid ""
"Kdenlive has expanded all the clips inside the library item into the bin "
"folder :guilabel:`Pasted clips`. You can rename the folder if you want. "
"Another library clip will expand into a new :guilabel:`Pasted clips` folder. "
"So you may want to keep those separate. Your choice."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive rozbalil všetky klipy vnútri položky knižnice do priečinka koša :"
"guilabel:`Pasted clips`. Priečinok môžete premenovať podľa vlastného "
"uváženia. Ďalší klip z knižnice sa rozbalí do nového priečinka :guilabel:"
"`Pasted clips`. Preto možno budete chcieť tieto priečinky oddeliť. Voľba je "
"na vás."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:176
msgid ""
"After successful expansion, you may now remove the original library clip "
"from your bin. It is not needed anymore (as you can also tell from the "
"missing reference count)."
msgstr ""
"Po úspešnom rozbalení môžete odstrániť pôvodný klip z knižnice zo svojho "
"koša. Už nie je potrebný (čo možno rozpoznáte aj podľa chýbajúceho počtu "
"odkazov)."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:184
msgid "Clip Expansion Details"
msgstr "Podrobnosti rozšírenia klipu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:190
msgid "Timeline with library clip (1) and expanded (2)"
msgstr "Časová os s klipom z knižnice (1) a rozbaleným klipom (2)"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:192
msgid ""
"Library clips will be expanded **from the bottom up**. This means that in "
"case a library clip contains multiple tracks, then you need to place the "
"library on a track with enough room (i.e. tracks) above for the clip to "
"expand."
msgstr ""
"Klipy z knižnice sa rozbalia **zdola nahor**. To znamená, že ak klip z "
"knižnice obsahuje viacero stôp, musíte knižnicu umiestniť na stopu s "
"dostatočným priestorom (t. j. stopami) nad ňou, aby sa klip mohol rozbaliť."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:196
msgid ""
"If there are not enough tracks above the library clip, yet there are enough "
"tracks in the timeline, then Kdenlive will attempt to **shuffle the library "
"clip down** a number of tracks before expanding it."
msgstr ""
"Ak nie je dostatok stôp nad klipom z knižnice, ale v časovej osi je dostatok "
"stôp celkovo, Kdenlive sa pokúsi **posunúť klip z knižnice nadol** o "
"niekoľko stôp pred jeho rozbalením."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:198
msgid ""
"In any case, to expand a library clip into its contents, you will always "
"need **necessary free space in the timeline**. This means that there cannot "
"be any clips or transitions within the start and end of the library clip on "
"as many adjacent tracks as are needed when expanding a multi-track library "
"item. Simply put: just make sure that the library item has room to expand. "
"There can be other clips and transitions above and below the library clip, "
"they just need to be outside of the area of expansion."
msgstr ""
"V každom prípade, na rozbalenie klipu z knižnice do jeho obsahu budete vždy "
"potrebovať **potrebný voľný priestor v časovej osi**. To znamená, že v "
"rozsahu od začiatku do konca klipu z knižnice nesmú byť žiadne klipy ani "
"prechody na toľkých susedných stopách, koľko je potrebných pri rozbaľovaní "
"položky knižnice s viacerými stopami. Jednoducho povedané: len sa uistite, "
"že položka knižnice má priestor na rozbalenie. Iné klipy a prechody nad a "
"pod klipom z knižnice môžu byť, musia sa však nachádzať mimo oblasti "
"rozbaľovania."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:205
msgid ""
"Timeline with expanded library clip abutting a clip with a transition in the "
"top-most track"
msgstr ""
"Časová os s rozbaleným klipom z knižnice tesne pri klipe s prechodom na "
"najvyššej stope"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:207
msgid ""
"You can also **expand a library immediately below a transition**; that is, "
"the library clip is on the next lower track in the timeline. This is useful "
"for such cases where you, for instance, have a clip running the full length "
"of your project on the topmost track and showing your company logo, channel "
"logo, or something similar. If you then use an explicit transition added to "
"this clip over compositing, you can still correctly expand the library clip "
"on the second-topmost track."
msgstr ""
"Môžete tiež **rozbaliť knižnicu priamo pod prechodom**; to znamená, že klip "
"z knižnice sa nachádza na nasledujúcej nižšej stope v časovej osi. To je "
"užitočné napríklad v prípadoch, keď máte na najvyššej stope klip "
"prechádzajúci celou dĺžkou projektu a zobrazujúci logo vašej spoločnosti, "
"logo kanála alebo niečo podobné. Ak potom použijete explicitný prechod "
"pridaný k tomuto klipu cez kompozitovanie, môžete stále správne rozbaliť "
"klip z knižnice na druhej najvyššej stope."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:214
msgid "Configuring Your Library Storage Location"
msgstr "Konfigurácia umiestnenia úložiska knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:216
msgid ""
"All items in your Kdenlive library are stored in a user-configurable place "
"inside your file system. The default location, unless configured otherwise, "
"is where your other semi-temporary caching data is stored. Typically, this "
"is :file:`$HOME/.local/share/kdenlive/library` (Linux) and :file:`%APPDATA%\\"
"\\Roaming\\\\kdenlive\\\\library` (Windows). Your library clips are then "
"stored inside this directory, as well as in subdirectories in case you also "
"use library folders."
msgstr ""
"Všetky položky vo vašej knižnici Kdenlive sú uložené na mieste "
"konfigurovateľnom používateľom vo vašom súborovom systéme. Predvolené "
"umiestnenie, ak nie je nakonfigurované inak, je tam, kde sú uložené ostatné "
"semi-dočasné údaje vyrovnávacej pamäte. Typicky ide o :file:`$HOME/.local/"
"share/kdenlive/library` (Linux) a :file:`%APPDATA%\\\\Roaming\\\\kdenlive\\"
"\\library` (Windows). Klipy z vašej knižnice sú potom uložené v tomto "
"adresári, ako aj v podadresároch v prípade, že používate aj priečinky "
"knižnice."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:222
msgid "Setting the library folder location"
msgstr "Nastavenie umiestnenia priečinka knižnice"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:224
msgid ""
"To change the location of your library, go to :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"Settings --> Configure Kdenlive`. Next, select the section :guilabel:"
"`Environment`. Switch to the :guilabel:`Default folders` tab. Locate the "
"part titled :guilabel:`Library folder`, and deselect the option :guilabel:"
"`Use default folder`. Select or enter another location for your Kdenlive "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Ak chcete zmeniť umiestnenie knižnice, prejdite na :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"Settings --> Configure Kdenlive`. Potom vyberte sekciu :guilabel:"
"`Environment`. Prepnite na záložku :guilabel:`Default folders`. Nájdite časť "
"s názvom :guilabel:`Library folder` a zrušte výber možnosti :guilabel:`Use "
"default folder`. Vyberte alebo zadajte iné umiestnenie pre vašu knižnicu "
"Kdenlive."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:226
msgid ""
"Kdenlive will not move existing library files to the new location you have "
"set. You will need to do this manually using a file browser or from the "
"command line."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive nepresunie existujúce súbory knižnice na nové umiestnenie, ktoré "
"ste nastavili. Budete to musieť urobiť manuálne pomocou správcu súborov "
"alebo z príkazového riadka."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:231
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:237
msgid "**Sources**"
msgstr "**Zdroje**"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:237
msgid ""
"The original text was submitted by user *TheDiveO* to the now defunct "
"kdenlive.org blog. For this documentation it has been lifted from |"
"kdenlive_org|, updated and adapted to match the overall style."
msgstr ""
"Pôvodný text bol predložený používateľom *TheDiveO* na teraz nefunkčný blog "
"kdenlive.org. Pre túto dokumentáciu bol prevzatý z |kdenlive_org|, "
"aktualizovaný a upravený tak, aby zodpovedal celkovému štýlu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:241
msgid ""
"You can use the file manager of your choice to manage your library. Kdenlive "
"simply reads the contents of the directory you specified in the settings. "
"For more complex file management this is the recommended way. Changes to the "
"library folder made outside of Kdenlive are reflected in near real-time."
msgstr ""
"Na správu knižnice môžete použiť správcu súborov podľa vlastného výberu. "
"Kdenlive jednoducho číta obsah adresára, ktorý ste zadali v nastaveniach. "
"Pre zložitejšiu správu súborov ide o odporúčaný spôsob. Zmeny v priečinku "
"knižnice vykonané mimo Kdenlive sa prejavia takmer v reálnom čase."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/library.rst:243
msgid ""
"For more complex renaming tasks use the file manager or bulk rename utility "
"of your choice. Changes to the library folder made outside of Kdenlive are "
"reflected in near real-time."
msgstr ""
"Pre zložitejšie úlohy premenovania použite správcu súborov alebo nástroj na "
"hromadné premenovanie podľa vlastného výberu. Zmeny v priečinku knižnice "
"vykonané mimo Kdenlive sa prejavia takmer v reálnom čase."
